{
  "slug": "waldo-fyi",
  "name": "Waldo Fyi",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Waldo strategy agent skills for ad intelligence, social listening, web research, data analysis, and archival knowledge — powered by the Waldo MCP connector",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**, **11 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `ad-intelligence` (Trigger when the user says \"what ads is [brand] running\", \"show me [competitor] creatives\", \"how is [brand] advertising\",…), `archival-knowledge` (Trigger when the user says \"what insights do we have on [brand]\", \"show me brand mentions\", \"pull up…), `data-analysis` (Trigger when the user says \"crunch the numbers\", \"compare Q3 vs Q4\", \"what does this data show\", \"break…), `social-intelligence` (Trigger when the user says \"what are people saying about [brand]\", \"how is [brand] perceived\", \"sentiment on [X]\",…), `trends-research` (Research what's trending — cultural shifts, emerging signals, viral hashtags, forward-looking patterns — by running social trending tools,…), `web-research` (Trigger when the user says \"research [topic]\", \"deep dive on [X]\", \"compare [A] vs [B]\", \"audit [website]\", \"what…)\n- **Commands** (11): `ad-teardown` ([ad] Tear down a competitor's paid creative across Meta, Google, and LinkedIn ad libraries — messaging, targeting, hooks,…), `audience-profile` ([social] Build an audience profile — demographics, psychographics, daily-life snapshot, brand affinities, tensions, where to reach them), `check-signals` ([archival] Search captured brand intelligence in your Waldo workspace — signal feeds (mentions, owned media, paid ads, news,…), `data-analysis` ([data] Analyze structured data (CSV, Excel, PDF tables, JSON) — calculations, comparisons, trend analysis, growth rates, pivot tables,…), `deep-dive` ([research] Multi-source deep-dive on a brand, category, industry, audience, or topic — market position, competitive landscape, recent moves,…), `news-digest` ([archival] Weekly digest of news, signals, and brand mentions from your Waldo workspace — what mattered, why it…), `prospect-intel` ([research] Cold new-business prospect research — company snapshot, org chart, executive profile, agency relationships, outreach hooks for BD/growth), `social-listening` ([social] Listen to organic conversations across Reddit, Instagram, TikTok, X, Facebook, LinkedIn, YouTube — sentiment, viral content, creator…), and 3 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `waldo`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install waldo-fyi@claude-community` from `waldo-fyi/waldo-claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
